WEBVTT

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:13.260
Ikaruga-san...

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:16.870
I love you!

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:30.900
It doesn't matter when

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.330
I always think of your smile

00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:41.800
The single word that I couldn't say

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:47.000
I've always wanted to say it to you

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:50.480
I pray so that our hearts may be connected

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:53.220
But I couldn't see through the clouds

00:00:53.060 --> 00:00:57.970
In front of you, I swear that

00:00:57.820 --> 00:01:00.830
I will always be your side

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:07.710
The future we anticipate is still far away

00:01:07.670 --> 00:01:11.270
You say that it's at the end of the world

00:01:11.290 --> 00:01:16.940
As long as I have a reason to shed tears

00:01:16.790 --> 00:01:21.800
I will not stop moving towards it

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:31.730
As usual, we'll be together today

00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:37.180
In the same world

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:52.590
Ninth Longsword

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:52.590
Suicidal Summer Festival!?

00:01:53.970 --> 00:01:55.970
Okay, we're done.

00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:59.500
You're all starting to get the form right.

00:02:00.310 --> 00:02:00.970
But...

00:02:01.510 --> 00:02:05.470
it'll be more effective if you stop the sword right here after you swing it.

00:02:07.470 --> 00:02:10.480
Okay, thank you very much.

00:02:11.110 --> 00:02:15.560
Ikaruga-san is so good with children.

00:02:15.560 --> 00:02:17.490
She's like the Virgin Mary.

00:02:18.350 --> 00:02:19.990
That's no good.

00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:22.240
I'm going to get angry.

00:02:22.790 --> 00:02:25.550
I'll train hard so that I can beat that shit samurai some day.

00:02:25.550 --> 00:02:27.750
I love you!

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:27.750
Washizu-dono...

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:29.450
Washizu-dono!

00:02:29.690 --> 00:02:30.710
Take that!

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:33.750
What are you staring at?

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:36.710
If this was a real duel, you'd already be dead.

00:02:37.060 --> 00:02:40.380
Ikaruga-san should be teaching me.

00:02:40.380 --> 00:02:42.960
Why is this happening?

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:45.050
Not like that...

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:47.040
Hey!

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:49.480
Geez, didn't I tell you not to do that?

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:51.680
Don't be so strict.

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:55.480
Teaching is so difficult.

00:02:57.070 --> 00:02:59.910
Are you okay, Wassan?

00:02:59.910 --> 00:03:01.800
Like hell I am, Torigaya.

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:03.070
Damn it!

00:03:03.070 --> 00:03:06.660
Why do I have to be paired with that shit samurai?

00:03:07.650 --> 00:03:12.010
I only came here to get closer to Ikaruga-san.

00:03:12.010 --> 00:03:16.860
Why is a delinquent like me being so hesitant?

00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:18.130
This is so unlike me.

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:20.650
Okay, I've decided, Torigaya!

00:03:20.650 --> 00:03:22.220
I'll tell her outright!

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:24.170
Go for it! Wassan, you're so cool.

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:25.270
What do you mean?

00:03:25.270 --> 00:03:26.600
Obviously,

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:29.050
"I like you, Ikaruga-san!

00:03:29.050 --> 00:03:32.520
I really want you to teach me swordfighting!"

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:38.850
W-What are you yelling randomly?

00:03:38.850 --> 00:03:40.380
N-No...

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:44.020
Do you have heat stroke, you delinquent gorilla?!

00:03:46.060 --> 00:03:47.810
Hey, who's she calling a gorilla?

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:49.730
That woman pisses me off.

00:03:49.730 --> 00:03:52.910
Hey, Wassan, wasn't that really bad?

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:55.520
I mean, her last name is also Ikaruga, right?

00:03:55.520 --> 00:03:57.170
How does that matter to me?

00:03:57.980 --> 00:04:01.720
It looked like you were confessing to her.

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:06.060
He confessed to me... He confessed to me...!

00:04:06.060 --> 00:04:07.530
He confessed to me!

00:04:07.530 --> 00:04:09.270
I've never had someone confess to me before!

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:13.730
Not my sister, but me.

00:04:14.950 --> 00:04:17.730
Don't be so sad, Yoichi-niichan.

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:23.030
I'm not good enough to teach others.

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:28.230
With Yoichi-san like that, I'm gonna have to ask you to teach Washizu-kun, Ayame.

00:04:37.940 --> 00:04:38.750
Start.

00:04:39.330 --> 00:04:40.950
U-Um...

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:43.540
Hey, listen to me.

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:45.050
It's a misunderstanding!

00:04:45.980 --> 00:04:47.670
What happened before—

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:51.690
That was the sixth technique, Kogarashi.

00:04:51.690 --> 00:04:53.390
Aim at your opponent's neck, then go for a direct strike.

00:04:54.210 --> 00:04:56.150
Stand up, you useless delinquent.

00:04:56.630 --> 00:04:57.810
Damn it...

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:00.510
Who are you calling useless, you bitch?!

00:05:00.510 --> 00:05:02.860
I'm calling you useless! Am I wrong?!

00:05:03.760 --> 00:05:05.810
What a terrific battle!

00:05:05.810 --> 00:05:07.610
They've got amazing spirit!

00:05:07.610 --> 00:05:09.370
They're perfect for each other!

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:10.740
You really suck!

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:12.360
No, I don't!

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:15.490
It's so hot.

00:05:15.490 --> 00:05:16.870
Hot, hot...

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:20.200
Popsicles are so good.

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:23.730
Thank you very much!

00:05:23.730 --> 00:05:24.840
Thank you.

00:05:25.230 --> 00:05:27.510
Get home safely!

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:28.990
Come again, Washizu-kun.

00:05:28.990 --> 00:05:30.890
Y-Yes, definitely!

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:33.390
Shit!

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:37.550
I didn't get to talk to Ikaruga-san today,

00:05:37.550 --> 00:05:40.460
and her sister thinks I confessed to her.

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:42.950
The younger sister likes the samurai.

00:05:42.950 --> 00:05:45.060
This is so complicated.

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:47.910
The younger sister likes the samurai?

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:49.510
Doesn't she?

00:05:49.510 --> 00:05:51.640
How do you know that?!

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:54.110
Well, you can tell by just looking.

00:05:55.610 --> 00:05:56.860
Torigaya!

00:05:56.860 --> 00:06:00.240
You bastard, your insight is amazing.

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:03.920
Asamigawa's evening festival is tomorrow, isn't it?

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:06.540
Should I wear a yukata?

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:08.520
Yokkou's Washizu...

00:06:08.520 --> 00:06:09.930
Don't look him in the eyes.

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:16.110
I have a great idea!

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:18.190
Help me, Torigaya!

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:20.350
All right! That's the spirit, Wassan!

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:21.940
I'll definitely help you!

00:06:24.100 --> 00:06:27.060
He's definitely planning to beat someone up at the festival.

00:06:27.060 --> 00:06:29.440
It'll be a bloodbath...

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:38.460
It's pretty lively.

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:39.940
That's right.

00:06:39.940 --> 00:06:41.350
Oh yeah, Torigaya.

00:06:41.350 --> 00:06:43.690
Haven't you gotten shorter as of late?

00:06:43.690 --> 00:06:45.540
How's that possible?

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:46.830
I guess...

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:49.930
Washizu-kun! Torigaya-kun!

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:53.970
Sorry, did you wait?

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:58.480
I'm sorry, it took a while to help everyone get dressed.

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:03.350
N-No, not at all.

00:07:03.350 --> 00:07:05.730
We've been here for an hour...

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:10.240
All right, the samurai and the younger sister are here too.

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:14.060
Wow, it's pretty big this year.

00:07:14.060 --> 00:07:19.010
The all-you-can-eat cake stand and the ramen shops are on completely opposite sides!

00:07:19.010 --> 00:07:20.940
I guess we can't go everywhere.

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:22.580
Yeah, exactly.

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:28.130
Asamigawa Festival

00:07:30.250 --> 00:07:34.100
we should check things out in pairs.

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:35.610
What are you talking about?

00:07:35.610 --> 00:07:37.390
If you do that—

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:40.390
I approve of your idea!

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:42.540
Okay, everyone, let's draw numbers.

00:07:42.540 --> 00:07:45.160
Amazing, you already prepared this?

00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:47.190
Same numbers get paired up.

00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:50.690
Not to mention we've fixed the results.

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:54.200
Torigaya, you better do this right.

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:58.540
I'll be in a lovey-dovey pair with Ikaruga-san,

00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:01.770
the samurai and the younger sister will be together so they won't interfere,

00:08:01.770 --> 00:08:04.620
and I'll leave the kids to Torigaya.

00:08:05.010 --> 00:08:07.020
It's flawless!

00:08:07.020 --> 00:08:08.500
Now then, let's see the results!

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:09.710
One, two!

00:08:11.310 --> 00:08:12.770
I'm number three!

00:08:12.770 --> 00:08:14.620
We're also number three!

00:08:14.620 --> 00:08:16.390
Let's have fun, Kei-chan.

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:16.990
Okay.

00:08:16.990 --> 00:08:19.610
Kagome, walking must be tough since you're so small.

00:08:19.610 --> 00:08:21.390
Do you want to ride on my shoulders?

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:24.570
Kei-chan, you've improved your mobility, haven't you?

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:26.370
I'm number nine.

00:08:26.370 --> 00:08:28.660
You're with me then.

00:08:28.660 --> 00:08:30.820
Hey! Torigaya!

00:08:31.520 --> 00:08:33.400
I'm sorry, Wassan.

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:36.040
I confused six and nine.

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:38.770
Why did you use multiples of three?!

00:08:38.770 --> 00:08:41.330
Wouldn't one, two, and three have worked?!

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:45.210
Oh, they'll sell out of their sixty puddings if we just stand here.

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:46.260
Let's hurry!

00:08:46.260 --> 00:08:47.330
Oh, you're right.

00:08:48.020 --> 00:08:49.620
See you, Wassan!

00:08:49.620 --> 00:08:51.140
Let's go!

00:08:51.140 --> 00:08:52.840
We'll meet up later!

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:55.780
H-Hey! Torigaya!

00:08:55.780 --> 00:08:56.340
Wait—

00:08:56.610 --> 00:09:00.130
I have you of all people...

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:03.980
You even had us draw from a box...

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:05.860
I bet you fixed the results.

00:09:05.860 --> 00:09:08.020
That's pretty cheap, you coward.

00:09:14.230 --> 00:09:16.030
Damn it!

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:20.460
It's quite lively!

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:22.790
What's that?

00:09:23.240 --> 00:09:25.350
He's so happy.

00:09:25.350 --> 00:09:27.330
It's like he's a little kid.

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:33.080
This reminds me of the date we had before...

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:38.960
Um... Yoichi-san...

00:09:40.340 --> 00:09:42.720
Does this yukata look weird on me?

00:09:50.280 --> 00:09:52.560
What's that over there?

00:10:09.160 --> 00:10:12.040
This is your fan, isn't it?

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:14.120
Oh, thank you.

00:10:16.250 --> 00:10:20.250
If it's all right with you, can you tell me your name?

00:10:20.660 --> 00:10:25.000
I'm Karasuma Yoichi, a swordsman of the Ukiha Kamikaze style.

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:28.230
I'm currently undergoing martial arts training in the city.

00:10:28.590 --> 00:10:31.200
Oh, sword training?

00:10:31.200 --> 00:10:32.400
Indeed.

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:36.030
Speaking of which, it seems like you're also a martial artist.

00:10:38.620 --> 00:10:41.020
Yes, more or less.

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:45.110
My name is Saginomiya Ukyo.

00:10:45.110 --> 00:10:47.580
I have a feeling we'll meet again.

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:49.900
Yoichi-san!

00:10:49.900 --> 00:10:52.420
Geez, don't leave me behind.

00:10:52.820 --> 00:10:55.230
You were so hard to find.

00:10:55.230 --> 00:10:56.920
Are you listening?

00:10:57.970 --> 00:10:59.420
Ibuki-san...

00:10:59.420 --> 00:11:01.700
Pudding mission complete!

00:11:01.700 --> 00:11:03.180
Kagome, what's next?

00:11:03.480 --> 00:11:05.830
There are creamy yam puffs at the west gate!

00:11:05.830 --> 00:11:07.700
Okay, let's hurry.

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:09.980
Hey, you ladies there.

00:11:12.140 --> 00:11:17.400
We, the Saginomiya Yoshian store, from Arashiyama, Kyoto,

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:21.110
are currently putting on a food sampling service of high quality dishes.

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:22.250
Really?

00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:23.590
They look delicious!

00:11:23.590 --> 00:11:26.000
We can seriously take some?

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:27.430
Yes, go ahead.

00:11:27.430 --> 00:11:29.040
Don't mind if I do!

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:35.310
Only one hundred of these diamond-grade apples, or "Jewels," are harvested each year.

00:11:35.310 --> 00:11:37.260
We've made them into caramel apples.

00:11:37.260 --> 00:11:39.460
We also have cotton candy made with high quality sugar.

00:11:39.460 --> 00:11:41.550
There are also beef skewers from Matsusaka.

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:44.060
We'll try them all!

00:11:44.060 --> 00:11:46.670
Crap, this is really good!

00:11:46.670 --> 00:11:49.360
The caramel apple is so sweet!

00:11:49.360 --> 00:11:52.120
The Ikaruga family are nothing but peasants.

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:54.390
They can't resist worldly goods.

00:11:58.520 --> 00:12:00.280
This is amazing, Angie!

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:02.870
I never knew a festival could be so fun!

00:12:02.870 --> 00:12:05.070
Please don't move, Tsubasa-sama.

00:12:05.070 --> 00:12:07.310
Angela-chan, you're amazing.

00:12:07.310 --> 00:12:10.080
Your makeup skill is truly amazing.

00:12:10.390 --> 00:12:13.100
Within the Tsubame Benten style, makeup techniques are—

00:12:13.100 --> 00:12:16.080
W-We went to a makeup school before.

00:12:16.850 --> 00:12:20.580
Speaking of which, you don't look scary at all.

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:22.170
Are you a cat-girl?

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:23.450
I guess.

00:12:23.450 --> 00:12:25.690
I bought those clothes twenty years ago.

00:12:25.690 --> 00:12:29.270
Finally, someone worthy of them has appeared.

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:31.150
Now then, Tsubasa-sama.

00:12:31.150 --> 00:12:32.890
Let's finish with the makeup.

00:12:33.660 --> 00:12:34.390
Huh?

00:12:35.010 --> 00:12:36.400
Ikaruga-san?

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:41.060
Wait, does this mean that he's here?

00:12:41.060 --> 00:12:43.780
Wow, I really want to see even a glimpse of him.

00:12:44.760 --> 00:12:46.770
I'm satisfied with my own work of art!

00:12:46.770 --> 00:12:49.150
What do you think, Tsubasa-sama?

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:52.850
What an amazing replacement technique!

00:12:52.850 --> 00:12:56.040
I mean, where did you go, Tsubasa-sama?!

00:12:58.010 --> 00:12:59.540
Oh no...

00:12:59.780 --> 00:13:02.150
Where did Ibuki-dono go?

00:13:02.150 --> 00:13:03.550
Gentleman over there.

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:09.050
Would you be interested in playing a shooting game?

00:13:23.020 --> 00:13:24.230
Look at that girl!

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:26.240
She's cute!

00:13:26.710 --> 00:13:31.030
Hey, wait for me, Ikaruga-san!

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:34.070
But I'm really happy...

00:13:34.070 --> 00:13:35.960
Geez, you're too excited.

00:13:36.360 --> 00:13:38.270
Oh, it's goldfish scooping.

00:13:38.270 --> 00:13:39.460
Are you good at it?

00:13:39.810 --> 00:13:42.920
Just watch, I can probably get about ten.

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:45.270
Huh? That's weird...

00:13:45.270 --> 00:13:46.880
It can't be helped.

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:48.430
I'll do it for you.

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:52.430
Wow, amazing!

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:54.530
I love you, Washizu-kun.

00:13:54.530 --> 00:13:56.270
Huh? Isn't that Yokkou's Washizu?

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:58.940
Wow, even his girlfriend is cute.

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:01.440
Why are you daydreaming, you good-for-nothing?

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:05.560
Let's walk around a bit and then head to the meeting place.

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:08.260
Isn't that Yokkou's Washizu?

00:14:08.260 --> 00:14:10.890
He's getting pushed around by a girl.

00:14:10.890 --> 00:14:11.910
That's so lame.

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:14.910
Fresh! There are a lot here.

00:14:15.170 --> 00:14:16.400
Why?

00:14:16.400 --> 00:14:19.420
Why am I with her?

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:21.330
Did you say something?

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:27.990
Too bad you can't scoop away your uselessness.

00:14:27.990 --> 00:14:29.390
Well said...

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:31.950
Huh?

00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:33.930
You're awful, young man.

00:14:34.730 --> 00:14:36.930
This sucks!

00:14:39.240 --> 00:14:42.880
I can't attack an innocent being...

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:46.640
Gosh, it's only a game.

00:14:46.640 --> 00:14:48.980
Y-You're right.

00:14:48.980 --> 00:14:49.950
Well then...

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:56.240
That's unfortunate, you're really bad at this.

00:14:57.290 --> 00:15:00.140
I've never used a gun before.

00:15:00.140 --> 00:15:02.200
If only I could use a sword...

00:15:02.200 --> 00:15:04.430
But then it wouldn't be a shooting game.

00:15:04.430 --> 00:15:06.140
Oh, Ibuki-dono.

00:15:06.140 --> 00:15:08.920
Hey, lady, would you like to give it a shot?

00:15:09.520 --> 00:15:15.930
You'll win a trip to the hot springs for you and your family if you can shoot down that golden fish.

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:17.580
Really?

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:18.580
I'll try.

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:21.260
Leave it to me, I'll definitely shoot it down.

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:28.690
Congratulations!

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:32.690
We have a winner for the free hot spring trip!

00:15:32.690 --> 00:15:35.740
Wow! I did it, Yoichi-san!

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:37.660
That's amazing, Ibuki-dono.

00:15:38.930 --> 00:15:39.910
That wind just then...

00:15:42.900 --> 00:15:44.880
Oh, Ibuki-san...

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:47.410
You're too cute.

00:15:49.270 --> 00:15:52.970
I did my hair and dressed up,

00:15:53.610 --> 00:15:55.970
but I couldn't get him to look at me.

00:15:56.630 --> 00:16:00.480
It's all because a coward played some dirty tricks.

00:16:00.710 --> 00:16:02.120
Are you done yet?

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:03.660
Don't give me that "coward" crap!

00:16:03.660 --> 00:16:04.270
What?

00:16:04.270 --> 00:16:06.440
I said you're a coward. Am I wrong?

00:16:06.960 --> 00:16:10.190
Just because you couldn't beat the samurai, you resorted to childish tricks!

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:14.490
Being confessed to by a coward doesn't make me happy at all!

00:16:14.840 --> 00:16:16.940
No! You misunderstood!

00:16:17.230 --> 00:16:19.530
That line wasn't for you anyway!

00:16:19.530 --> 00:16:21.450
I wanted to tell your sister!

00:16:21.890 --> 00:16:25.250
A girl like you isn't cute at all compared to your sister!

00:16:31.110 --> 00:16:32.150
What's wrong?

00:16:32.150 --> 00:16:34.290
C'mon, fight back!

00:16:35.030 --> 00:16:36.600
I see...

00:16:37.690 --> 00:16:39.420
I thought it was strange.

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:42.810
Because it was me, not my sister.

00:16:45.410 --> 00:16:46.720
I'm sorry...

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:49.690
I guess I can never be better than my sister.

00:16:52.730 --> 00:16:55.740
W-What's going on?

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:59.160
Ibuki-dono! Where are you?

00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:06.120
Samurai...

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:08.660
Go.

00:17:09.810 --> 00:17:11.990
Didn't you want to be with him?

00:17:11.990 --> 00:17:15.340
H-H-H-How's that even possible?

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:16.300
I don't really...

00:17:16.650 --> 00:17:21.600
I-It's boring walking around with you, so I'll leave.

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:22.990
In the end, you're just leaving.

00:17:22.990 --> 00:17:24.480
You're so not cute.

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:27.140
Hurry up and leave.

00:17:27.140 --> 00:17:29.310
That way I can be with Ikaruga-san—

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:38.570
What's with her?

00:17:38.570 --> 00:17:40.520
Her feet are shaking...

00:17:40.520 --> 00:17:42.190
Her shoulders are too.

00:17:43.460 --> 00:17:47.300
Was she always this small?

00:17:49.650 --> 00:17:50.840
Sa—

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:51.840
Samurai—

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:55.420
Hey, Yoichi-san, you left me behind again!

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:56.300
Ibuki-dono.

00:17:56.300 --> 00:17:58.880
You're too easily attracted by things.

00:17:58.880 --> 00:18:00.210
I'm sorry.

00:18:00.210 --> 00:18:03.210
It's so hard to find you.

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:02.100
Hey.

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:07.740
You told me just now.

00:18:07.740 --> 00:18:11.980
My sister has much more charm than I do.

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:15.230
Samurai wants to be with my sister too...

00:18:18.250 --> 00:18:19.310
Younger sister...

00:18:24.250 --> 00:18:25.450
I'm sorry!

00:18:26.060 --> 00:18:27.860
You're right.

00:18:27.860 --> 00:18:30.580
I was dirty.

00:18:30.930 --> 00:18:32.280
I'm a coward.

00:18:32.280 --> 00:18:34.960
Perhaps I'm useless, but...

00:18:35.700 --> 00:18:39.710
I'm much less useless than someone like you who gives up before the battle.

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:42.470
Watch and learn.

00:18:42.470 --> 00:18:45.390
I won't be a good-for-nothing anymore.

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:48.440
Since you dressed up so nicely, why don't you make him look at you?

00:18:50.610 --> 00:18:51.680
Ikaruga-san...

00:18:52.920 --> 00:18:53.780
Washizu-kun?

00:18:53.780 --> 00:18:55.110
Oh, Washizu-dono.

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:57.240
Come with me!

00:18:57.940 --> 00:18:59.730
Wait, Washizu-kun?

00:19:00.210 --> 00:19:02.730
There, I finally did it.

00:19:03.010 --> 00:19:05.240
Now it's your turn, younger sister.

00:19:05.770 --> 00:19:08.750
I guess this time, I'm left behind.

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:13.250
Well then, let's go together, Ayame-dono.

00:19:15.510 --> 00:19:19.260
I'm much less useless than someone like you who gives up before the battle.

00:19:24.210 --> 00:19:27.550
Well, if you help me carry this,

00:19:27.550 --> 00:19:30.520
I-I won't mind walking with you!

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:36.480
Ayame-dono?

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:40.530
It's not big at all, I can carry it by myself.

00:19:40.530 --> 00:19:43.490
I-I'm carrying half, so just be grateful!

00:19:56.590 --> 00:19:58.300
Wait, Washizu-kun!

00:19:58.810 --> 00:20:01.380
I've already come this far, there's no turning back!

00:20:01.710 --> 00:20:04.920
Today, I'll confess my feelings to you, Ikaruga-san!

00:20:05.670 --> 00:20:06.840
Listen...

00:20:06.840 --> 00:20:07.720
I...

00:20:12.930 --> 00:20:17.030
Geez, Washizu-kun grabbed Tsubasa-chan's hand and ran...

00:20:17.030 --> 00:20:19.090
This makeup is pretty good, right?

00:20:19.090 --> 00:20:21.200
I heard Angela-san did it herself.

00:20:21.200 --> 00:20:22.350
What should I do?

00:20:22.350 --> 00:20:23.740
He grabbed my hand.

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:25.940
Wow, that's really creepy!

00:20:25.940 --> 00:20:28.990
Wow, it's done really well.

00:20:29.420 --> 00:20:30.720
Scary...

00:20:30.720 --> 00:20:33.150
Isn't Angela-dono here?

00:20:33.150 --> 00:20:35.910
Angie is helping out at the haunted mansion.

00:20:37.890 --> 00:20:41.390
I didn't make any progress. I'm really useless.

00:20:41.390 --> 00:20:43.760
You're really useless, good-for-nothing.

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:46.290
I said I'm not a good-for—

00:20:46.920 --> 00:20:50.270
I take it from your expression that something good happened with the samurai?

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:52.860
A-Are you an idiot?

00:20:52.860 --> 00:20:53.520
Nothing really—

00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:55.700
Don't tell me you did that.

00:20:55.700 --> 00:20:58.170
W-What are you talking about, you pervert?!

00:20:58.170 --> 00:20:59.160
Pervert?!

00:20:59.160 --> 00:21:01.260
You pervert! Good-for-nothing pervert!

00:21:01.260 --> 00:21:03.770
Y-You bitch! I was the one who helped you...

00:21:03.770 --> 00:21:07.760
Those two seem even closer than before the festival.

00:21:07.760 --> 00:21:09.740
Ayame used to be really shy.

00:21:10.260 --> 00:21:12.750
Those two are quite a pair.

00:21:13.600 --> 00:21:14.730
Everyone, listen up.

00:21:14.730 --> 00:21:19.230
I managed to win a hot spring trip for us!

00:21:19.230 --> 00:21:20.710
A hot spring?

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:24.420
I won it at a cute girl's shooting game stand.

00:21:24.420 --> 00:21:26.460
I never thought I'd actually win it.

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:28.770
It's an uninhabited island.

00:21:28.770 --> 00:21:31.460
Ibuki-nee, you're really lucky.

00:21:31.460 --> 00:21:33.100
As expected of Ibuki-dono.

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:34.770
You're truly amazing!

00:21:40.050 --> 00:21:45.280
Even the golden fish couldn't stand after seeing such a sight.

00:21:45.280 --> 00:21:49.910
Seriously, you really like to be indirect about things.

00:21:49.910 --> 00:21:52.280
Your sickness is getting worse.

00:21:52.280 --> 00:21:53.550
Sickness?

00:21:53.550 --> 00:21:55.070
Who are you calling sick?

00:21:57.240 --> 00:21:59.130
That obsession with Ikaruga Ibuki, of course.

00:22:05.960 --> 00:22:06.980
Tsubasa-sama!

00:22:06.980 --> 00:22:08.530
Where are you?

00:22:08.530 --> 00:22:10.010
Tsubasa-sama!

00:22:20.650 --> 00:22:27.150
I regret not realizing

00:22:28.100 --> 00:22:34.720
That you were the most important person to me

00:22:35.700 --> 00:22:42.280
I have to deliver these feelings to you myself

00:22:43.310 --> 00:22:51.740
Please, stay by my side forever

00:22:51.340 --> 00:22:55.970
The same feelings that were born through a dream

00:22:55.770 --> 00:22:59.730
Make me hesitate a little

00:22:59.600 --> 00:23:06.720
When I open my heart and free myself from sadness

00:23:06.600 --> 00:23:10.590
I will seize tomorrow with both of my hands

00:23:10.490 --> 00:23:14.440
I hope you will light up the dawn in my heart

00:23:14.480 --> 00:23:16.790
You're not alone

00:23:16.590 --> 00:23:21.120
Because I love you

00:23:21.560 --> 00:23:25.730
I know you're afraid of change

00:23:25.570 --> 00:23:29.290
So I promise to stay by your side, smiling

00:23:29.150 --> 00:23:36.750
Let's change kindness into strength

00:23:39.990 --> 00:23:42.020
Next Time!

00:23:41.610 --> 00:23:44.510
This is Yoichi's father reporting from the hot springs.

00:23:42.020 --> 00:24:07.050
Tenth Longsword

00:23:42.020 --> 00:24:07.050
Secret Hot Springs
Deathmatch!

00:23:45.010 --> 00:23:46.540
On a certain day of a certain month, uh...

00:23:46.540 --> 00:23:49.350
Samurai A-kun along with the four sisters that went with him,

00:23:49.350 --> 00:23:52.490
B-san, C-san, D-san, and E-chan, for a total of five,

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:55.240
came to visit this place after winning a prize.

00:23:55.540 --> 00:23:57.760
Although it's a large and lavish hot spring trip,

00:23:57.760 --> 00:24:00.800
they got themselves into a certain situation.

00:24:00.800 --> 00:24:02.850
Please pay attention to the next episode for the details.

00:24:02.850 --> 00:24:04.870
Now, back to the studio.

00:24:04.870 --> 00:24:06.330
This was Yoichi's father, over.

00:24:07.050 --> 00:24:10.000
Don't miss the next episode!

00:24:08.760 --> 00:24:10.010
Oh, am I still on?
